## Adding a harness

The harnesses above are the ones this mate binary was built with, and each passed the harness contract suite (`internal/harness/catalog`): its capabilities carry evidence, its launches build, and its measured screens classify.
If the captain asks for another, say that it is not registered and that a Crew on it would be unsupervisable, because every row above - the busy signature especially - has to be measured and pass that suite before `mate state` can tell working from wedged.
